  "2026-10-21T16:05:53.089Z",codex-agent,"Plan: verify public package manifests, command registrations and npm availability, add memory and RLM catalog entries and independent roster membership, then regenerate fleet snapshots through the existing pipeline. No package pins or hosted services change."
  "2026-10-21T16:16:24.836Z",codex-agent,"The existing full generator encountered an unrelated pm-github/newer-SDK import incompatibility. Added an explicit package-name refresh mode to the same pipeline; refreshed only pm-memory and pm-rlm through real SDK registration discovery and npm lookups. Both return npm 404, so installation is refused; optional RLM endpoint/key requirements remain visible. Other receipts are preserved byte-for-byte."
